    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσχοινίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separate by a cord</i>: hence generally, <i>bar,
